            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Label",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " compression and rarefaction by C and R on it. In the graph given in Fig. 10.17 (c) and (d), label the axes and "
